A_242 - Just as you would take your pets for a walk, you can do the same with potted plants. Whether you're visiting a loved one, trekking, or filming a nature documentary (for example), you can also enhance the experience by bringing along minerals or jewelry, in some way. Those who own electric vehicles should keep this in mind (they're better suited for transporting potted plants because they vibrate less and are quieter). However, it's important to keep vibrations during transport to a minimum.